    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 — Mercenary Band</strong></p><p><strong>“We are not a problem. We are a subscription.”</strong></p><p>Mercenary Bands turn violence into a service industry. They’re disciplined when paid, unpredictable when not, and always looking for the next contract that lets them keep their code while breaking yours.</p><p><em>You are now a system inside the system. People feel you before they see you.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> When your Strike hits and either die shows a 10, you gain temporary Integrity equal to four times your tier.</li></ul>",
